  - The `.series` top 20/right 24 may overlap the logo; at 640x360, the series is at top-right, fine.
  - The title map's 4 chapter boxes at 640 width: `titlewrap` width min(880,92vw)=589px; 4 columns with 9px gaps → each 140px. Buttons 3 columns ~45px. Good.
  - The chapter header text (e.g., "青石夜渠") 12.5px + en hidden; fits.
  - The level numbers 11px; good.
  - The title footer two lines; at 360px height, they might be below the fold. We can hide the second footer (`titlefoot:last-child`) on short screens or reduce margins. The first footer has the hint; the second has the series/zero external. We can hide the second footer on mobile to save space. But the series mark is already top-right. Let's hide `.titlefoot:last-child` at max-height 560. Good.
  - The "最高分/进度" meta line fits.

Let's patch the CSS media query.

